    "d7aaaf6445879b4e13134c121f28e582d8ed7584efa79e254d734c3746cc7412": "# Project context\n\nAdd verified project context as it becomes useful. Start with [project permissions](rules/permissions.md) and preserve existing project instructions.\n",
    "e9633b602963046f86a1b1f7cf125d942263e105a1a2fb0734cc91787e52b9b2": "# Project permissions\n\nRead-only inspection may proceed. Explain the scope and risks and get explicit approval before writes or external changes. Approve each step by default. Preserve existing work, verify changes, and report results briefly.\n\nFor known breaking changes, explain the impact, alternatives, and recovery. Obtain three distinct explicit confirmations. Use native safeguards for risky actions.\n",
